---
import GenericPageLayout from '../../layouts/GenericPageLayout.astro';
import styles from '../../styles/about.module.css';
---

<GenericPageLayout 
  title="Grant Opportunities" 
  subtitle="Funding the future of agricultural innovation."
  heroImage="/media/DSC_3805.webp"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Research', href: '/research' },
    { label: 'Grants', href: '/research/grants' }
  ]}
>
  <div class={styles.contentWrapper}>
    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Research Funding</h2>
    <p class={styles.paragraph}>
      Securing external funding is crucial for high-impact laboratory research. FUAZ researchers are continuously supported by the Directorate of Academic Planning to develop competitive proposals for TETFund's National Research Fund (NRF) and international fellowships.
    </p>
    <ul class={styles.list}>
      <li><strong>TETFund NRF:</strong> Major multi-disciplinary agricultural engineering grants.</li>
      <li><strong>Institutional Seed Grant:</strong> Internal funding awarded by the Vice-Chancellor's office to kickstart early-career research.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</GenericPageLayout>
